{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52210","headline":"颂六十二首 三十五 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 三十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久猒无明树，方欣柰苑华。\n始入香山路，仍逢火宅车。\n慈父屡引接，幼子背恩赊。\n虽悟危藤鼠，终悲在箧虵。\n鹿苑禅林茂，鹫岭动枝柯。\n定华发智果，乘空具度河。\n法雨时时落，香云片片多。\n若爲将羽化，来济在尘罗。\n（见同书卷四九《华香篇》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52210.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52210","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}